{"id":28909,"slug":"heart-of-a-dog","title":"Heart of a Dog","year":2015,"country":"United States","duration":75,"spine":846,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28909-heart-of-a-dog","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/9e75209c0ba135a2446a65b3d5a5602e/0XOzE1HJa5L5A6Z0L94QxNKWfPT7jN_large.jpg","description":"Heart of a Dog marks the first feature film in thirty years by multimedia artist Laurie Anderson. A cinematic tone poem that flows from a sustained meditation on death and other forms of absence, the film seamlessly weaves together thoughts on Tibetan Buddhism, reincarnation, the modern surveillance state, and the artistic lives of dogs, with an elegy for the filmmaker’s beloved rat terrier, Lolabelle, at its heart. Narrated by Anderson with her characteristic wry wit, and featuring a plaintive, free-form score by the filmmaker, the tender and provocative Heart of a Dog continues Anderson’s four-and-a-half-decade career of imbuing the everyday with a sense of dreamlike wonder.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Laurie Anderson","slug":"laurie-anderson"}],"cast":[],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Laurie Anderson","slug":"laurie-anderson"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Laurie Anderson","slug":"laurie-anderson"},{"role":"Producers","person":"Laurie Anderson","slug":"laurie-anderson"},{"role":"Producers","person":"Dan Janvey","slug":null},{"role":"Coproducers","person":"Cooper Holoweski","slug":null},{"role":"Coproducers","person":"Noah Stahl","slug":null},{"role":"Coproducers","person":"Jim Cass","slug":null},{"role":"Coproducers","person":"Shaun MacDonald","slug":null},{"role":"Coproducers","person":"Jason Stern","slug":null},{"role":"Coproducers","person":"Jake Perlin","slug":null},{"role":"Narrated by","person":"Laurie Anderson","slug":"laurie-anderson"},{"role":"Music by","person":"Laurie Anderson","slug":"laurie-anderson"},{"role":"Cinematography by","person":"Laurie Anderson","slug":"laurie-anderson"},{"role":"Ci